      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When the town’s name was decided, Farnam and Sheffield flipped a coin to choose who would get the honor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheffield%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1852 the Sheffield Mining and Transportation Company built a two‑story depot that doubled as a hotel, lunch room, and meeting house.",
